    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom typing import Literal, get_args\n\nMode = Literal[\"read\", \"write\", \"append\"]\n\n\ndef is_valid_mode(value: str) -> bool:\n    return value in get_args(Mode)\n\nprint(is_valid_mode(\"write\"), is_valid_mode(\"delete\"))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom typing import Literal, get_args\n\nMode = Literal[\"read\", \"write\", \"append\"]\n\n\ndef is_valid_mode(value: str) -> bool:\n    return value in get_args(Mode)\n\nprint(is_valid_mode(\"write\"), is_valid_mode(\"delete\"))\n```"
